    },
    "If the app does not open:\n\n1. Settings → General → VPN & Device Management → tap your developer → Trust.\n2. Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode → On (the iPhone restarts once)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
